    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Den, an unlucky door salesman, is sent from Samara to Voronezh on his boss's orders. But his life turns upside down when he discovers a suitcase full of cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/extras/85eede8d2c1cd72354e9ba6c44ba616c.poster.avif?t=1755585784\" width=800 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/extras/85eede8d2c1cd72354e9ba6c44ba616c.webm?t=1755585784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/extras/85eede8d2c1cd72354e9ba6c44ba616c.mp4?t=1755585784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDEATH TRAIN!!! Samara \u2013 Voronezh.\u201d is an absurd comedic thriller. A kinetic novel about the dark side of freedom, trains, money, strong-willed people... and bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping story lasting 1\u20132 hours of reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 vivid characters whose stories intertwine on a single ill-fated train.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 memorable musical compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A second door as a gift! (Just kidding. This isn't charity.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/extras/d5107b124e0f92416d18b4540031541d.poster.avif?t=1755585784\" width=800 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka